<title>POLAND: Forte full 1996 group results.</title>
<headline>Forte full 1996 group results.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Forte SA preliminary results for the the financial year of the year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>							 1997	   1996</p>
<p>    group operating profit		     25.75  vs   22.20</p>
<p>    group pre-tax profit			 22.45  vs   11.01</p>
<p>    group net profit			     21.83  vs   10.83</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Forte SA.</p>
<p>    group net sales			     308.30  vs  238.09</p>
<p>    group costs of sales			210.07  vs  163.26</p>
<p>    group extraordinary loss		    0.95  vs    1.20</p>
<p>    group income tax				0.62  vs    0.18</p>
<p>    group other taxes			     0.00  vs    0.00</p>
<p>    group financial revenues		    6.41  vs    3.36</p>
<p>    group financial costs			 7.99  vs   13.03</p>
<p>    group investment				0.19  vs    3.01</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
